  "description": "A modern Bayeux (CometD) client for .NET Framework 4.7.2 to .NET 10, over WebSocket and long-polling. Authentication you can change at runtime: Basic, bearer and refreshing OAuth tokens, API keys, or your own. Reconnects with backoff, keeps the session across network failures, falls back from WebSocket where it is blocked. Works with CometD servers and the Salesforce Streaming API. Written from the Bayeux protocol specification.",
